  "details": "Compare the attached image and 34882 that should be used here.\n\n```\n\nCurrently unable to edit this message since it has been recently updated. \n\nThe message can be updated again in {0} minutes.\n\n```\n\n# Note\n\n- There is a suspicious space character at the end of the first sentence, like \"updated.(space)\"\n\n- There is a similar string 76554\n\n```\n\nCurrently unable to edit this message since it has been recently updated.\n\nCan be updated again in {0} minutes.\n\n```\n\nPlease delete this if it is not used.\n\n- It is strange to show it as \"in 0 minutes\". The substituted value might be wrong.\n\n- You'll see this error dialog\n\n1. Open the edit message dialog (`MM > Notifications > Edit Messages`)\n\n2. Edit one of the messages and confirm\n\n3. Try to edit the identical message again\n\n- This issue has been discussed on the Localization Discord. I report here because it still exists, and there seems to be no report. https://discord.com/channels/1096246414603997194/1097673670819840100/1235202068243812373",
